  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e4dd14f3b6be758",
      "translationZh": "2026年8月12日，阿里巴巴的Qwen团队发布了Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B。这是Qwen-Max级别模型首次以开放权重形式提供。该模型拥有2.4万亿总参数（每个token激活950亿参数），采用混合线性加全注意力架构，原生上下文长度高达262K tokens（可扩展至1M）。Qwen3.8旨在应对最具挑战性的智能体和推理工作负载，包括多步编码、长程规划和自主工具使用。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "666f6c63e89aba19",
      "translationZh": "开放权重模型赋予您完全的控制权。数据保留在您的基础设施内部，推理行为可以进行定制，并且在大规模部署时没有按令牌计算的 API 费用。其权衡在于运维方面：托管一个 2.4T 参数的模型需要专用的 GPU 基础设施和优化的服务栈。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cfad8e49044c2e64",
      "translationZh": "在本文中，我们展示了如何在 Amazon SageMaker HyperPod 上使用 vLLM 在 ml.p6-b300 实例（配备 8 块 NVIDIA B300 Blackwell Ultra GPU）上部署 Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B。我们涵盖了从集群配置到 OpenAI 兼容端点的完整流程，包括针对 NVFP4 量化、内置推理、工具调用以及原生多令牌预测（MTP）投机解码的 vLLM 配置。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b4fd253a53db271c",
      "translationZh": "这是我们在 Amazon SageMaker HyperPod 上部署开放万亿参数模型系列文章的第二篇。关于涵盖 Kimi K3 的第一篇文章，请参阅《在 Amazon SageMaker HyperPod 和 Amazon EKS 上部署 Kimi K3》。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9757c88f3a55a59f",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B 概览",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5503f9f66ed47274",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B（Qwen3.8-Max 的开放权重版本）是 Qwen 系列中规模最大、能力最强的模型。以下是与部署相关的关键架构细节摘要。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c70340519347cd12",
      "translationZh": "每个令牌激活的参数",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "65fc44328d8c4612",
      "translationZh": "细粒度混合专家（MoE）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f681da7464cc8b0b",
      "translationZh": "512 个路由专家 + 1 个共享专家（每个 token 激活 10 个路由专家）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4921f71f69dde41c",
      "translationZh": "3 × (门控 DeltaNet → MoE) → 1 × (门控注意力 → MoE)，重复",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d060db68d417301",
      "translationZh": "原生支持 262,144 个 token。可扩展至 1,010,000 个 token。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a40b163d8603c8aa",
      "translationZh": "原生 MTP 草稿头（无需独立模型即可启用推测解码）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2b3d3c787350e508",
      "translationZh": "混合注意力设计是高效长上下文推理的关键。门控 DeltaNet 层（92层中的69层）使用具有有界循环状态的线性注意力，用固定大小的内存取代不断增长的 KV 缓存。门控注意力层（92层中的23层）使用完全二次注意力以实现高保真令牌交互。这种 3:1 的比例在上下文扩展到 100 万个令牌时，保持了计算和内存的边界。这对于在多个轮次中累积工具输出、代码和推理轨迹的智能体工作负载来说是一个关键属性。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "804353b36ac8e668",
      "translationZh": "细粒度 MoE 将容量分布在 512 个小型专家模型上，而不是少数几个大型专家模型，从而提高了路由效率和专业化程度。每次前向传播大约只有 950 亿参数处于激活状态，因此服务成本跟踪的是激活参数，而不是全部 2.4T。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4f012ab37e3aeb8f",
      "translationZh": "能力和推理控制",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "00fc6a4d02a4b255",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.8 专为智能体执行而设计：多步骤编码、自主工具使用、长期规划和复杂研究工作流。它通过 reasoning_effort 参数（低、中、高）包含内置的推理控制，因此开发者可以在每次请求中用计算换取推理深度。对于困难的多步骤问题调高设置，对于高吞吐量任务调低设置。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ac01ffab3efb5698",
      "translationZh": "模型权重和量化",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "79430c96ffc5d383",
      "translationZh": "开源权重以标准 Transformers 格式发布在 Hugging Face 上。社区量化包括 MXFP4 和 NVFP4（W4A4），它们将模型压缩到约 1.2 TB，可以适配到配备 B300 Blackwell Ultra GPU 的单个 8-GPU 节点上。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c1e698ee2dcfcc6d",
      "translationZh": "基准测试亮点",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "65f42776b5214fd8",
      "translationZh": "根据供应商的基准测试结果，Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95 在研究工作流（PaperBench 93.0）、指令遵循（IFBench 82.8）和基于终端的编码（86.6）方面表现出色。它在大多数类别中与领先的前沿模型表现相当，在更难的仓库级任务（SWE-bench Pro）和通用工具使用（Toolathlon）方面仍有剩余空间。对于评估专有 API 自托管替代方案的机构来说，这些结果将 Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95 定位为可信的前沿级选项，特别是对于编码智能体和研究管道。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "df4e53b70b00f27a",
      "translationZh": "为什么 Amazon SageMaker HyperPod 适用于大型 MoE 推理",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c9acb29d02c6979a",
      "translationZh": "部署一个 2.4T 参数模型不仅仅是 GPU 问题。它需要编排来处理模型下载、容器调度、健康监控、自动扩展和节点故障，无需人工干预。Amazon SageMaker HyperPod 是为此类工作负载专门构建的。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "efed7eba29d1ebe9",
      "translationZh": "图 1：Amazon SageMaker HyperPod 的总体架构",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dbc624d72785a909",
      "translationZh": "EKS 编排的集群。HyperPod 集群使用 Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service (Amazon EKS) 作为控制平面。您获得完整的 Kubernetes 生态系统（ kubectl 、 Helm 图表、自定义资源定义），而 AWS 管理底层基础设施生命周期：网络、存储、GPU 驱动程序安装和 NVIDIA 设备插件。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c206b4259cde62ac",
      "translationZh": "推理 Operator。HyperPod 推理 Operator（自动安装或作为 EKS 插件安装）提供了一个单一的自定义资源定义（CRD），InferenceEndpointConfig ，声明式地指定您的模型、容器映像、GPU 资源请求和 vLLM 启动参数。Operator 处理：",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0f9b88f99f258a1b",
      "translationZh": "模型权重下载（来自 Hugging Face Hub、Amazon Simple Storage Service (Amazon S3) 或 Amazon FSx）。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f0a741fa383eaafe",
      "translationZh": "容器调度和 GPU 分配。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b917de12c480c9d3",
      "translationZh": "健康检查和就绪门控。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b07b8cda0f4f09c1",
      "translationZh": "滚动更新和端点生命周期管理。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cd4136d4092718f6",
      "translationZh": "通过 KEDA 使用 Amazon CloudWatch 或 Prometheus 指标进行自动扩缩容。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6401d65fdb098593",
      "translationZh": "配合灵活训练计划的预留容量。ml.p6-b300.48xlarge 实例类型需要预留容量。灵活训练计划提供承诺的 GPU 预留，可直接分配给您的 HyperPod 集群。这不会与按需池产生竞争，也没有冷启动容量风险。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "31591624aba52d47",
      "translationZh": "弹性。HyperPod 持续监控节点健康状况并自动替换降级的节点。对于全天候运行的持续推理工作负载，这减轻了手动检测和恢复硬件故障的运营开销。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3a44ed01729b25d1",
      "translationZh": "额外的推理功能（Inference Operator v3.x）：",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f3af04f8eb04f777",
      "translationZh": "分离的预填充和解码（DPD）——将预填充和解码分离到不同的 GPU 池中，以在并发负载下实现可预测的每令牌延迟。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "491d8763e2bddb21",
      "translationZh": "推理数据捕获——在端点、负载均衡器或 Pod 级别记录输入/输出。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4f3f6b1da9ea0d2c",
      "translationZh": "本地 NVMe 模型部署——从节点本地存储加载权重以减少冷启动延迟。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f9bfecd2fb191ed9",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Route 53 DNS 管理 – 为您的端点自动创建自定义域名记录。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7afa4dc3b12756ac",
      "translationZh": "简而言之：您编写一个 YAML 清单来描述要部署的内容。HyperPod 负责处理如何在大规模下可靠地运行它。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "653cf8df8d68d260",
      "translationZh": "基础设施规模：将硬件与模型相匹配",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "53993addf0836741",
      "translationZh": "p6-b300 实例",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0610fb1b4208e720",
      "translationZh": "ml.p6-b300.48xlarge 提供了在单节点上部署 Qwen3.8 所需的计算密度：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7cbce7d56e85337a",
      "translationZh": "每块 GPU 配备 288 GB HBM3e（总计 2.1 TB）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6cbb8cb50c2133b4",
      "translationZh": "NVLink + NVSwitch，14.4 TB/s 二分带宽",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    }
  ],
